  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Open Send to…",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>After you place a mark, tap <strong>Send to…</strong> on its card.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/69e459e0d23d88b4.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Pick where it goes",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p><strong>Feed</strong> keeps it in a feed for everyone in it. Tap <strong>Role</strong> to reach the phones of a role, such as HQ, that are online now.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/da9ace15bc672377.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Pick the role",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In <strong>Roles, only phones online now</strong>, tap <strong>HQ</strong>. Phones that come online later do not get it.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/401b173de6ed5296.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Check where it went",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The card shows where it went, <strong>→ HQ, 1 phone, no receipt</strong>. The firing area's label now reads <strong>Sent to HQ</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/3581a226bb6c9573.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "One tap next time",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Your next enemy mark offers <strong>→ HQ</strong> on its card. One tap sends it there.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/294610301e27965d.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Send from the map",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Or tap any mark on the map, then the share button on the ring, a box with an arrow up. The same Send sheet opens for that one item.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/a6ae32dd5847ca2f.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
